# Tripwire, not a home.
#
# Working notes for this repository live in ../rbe-notes, a PRIVATE sibling
# repository. Nothing should be written here on purpose -- see CLAUDE.md.
#
# This directory survives only so that a tool which still writes to the old
# location cannot leak into a push: this repository's remote is PUBLIC, and
# notes quote whatever was discussed, which can include material from private
# repositories.
#
# So: everything here is ignored, and this file is tracked so the rule arrives
# with a fresh clone. Do not add an exception below -- move the file to
# ../rbe-notes instead, or to docs/ if it is meant to be read by others.
*
!.gitignore
